---
description: Use installed agent-skills workflows from .agents/skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial technical work in this repo:

1. Route via `.agents/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md` when unsure which skill applies.
2. Read and follow the matching skill under `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
3. Open linked files under that skill’s `references/` or `.agents/references/` when the skill points to them.
4. Prefer project skills over guessing; the user should not need to say "read the skill" each time.

Project context and commands live in `AGENTS.md` — follow it.
